      "id": "claim_52455979ba9d4424851da0f55406c7af",
      "statement": "BT startup is lazy: LazyBtBackend::new only records configuration and bootstrap spawns the index-sync and idle-supervisor loops, starting the expensive irontide session with spawn_startup only when lightweight mode is off or the persisted index holds unfinished work.",
