      "statement": "SystemContext is the one struct that names types from four engine crates at once (limedl-store's Database, limedl-disk's buffer pool and services, limedl-http's RateLimiter, limedl-types' EventBus), which is why limedl-disk cannot depend on limedl-core: the dependency points the other way.",
